    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6695c0ad8dd998125e57ca88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我跟好歌剧一起度过的最初的三年，\n就这样波澜壮阔地结束了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebfdf72cbb996b62e570d5bc4eaf85da5bd0151b7b6cd505afd79ff349db1288",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
