    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c63a7cc4c7803ab06520536",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们缔造了不错的成绩与更大的冲击。\n然而，“世纪末霸王”可不会\n就这样安分下来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "479649b0dcc4d239ae9870543007f013b79e64aa9340da703ffb7d2fad96a108",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
