      "uid": "zhcn:5cff4afe66995b0f0a91487a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我倒觉得这名称取得很直接……\n不过仍然是一件喜事没错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42764f3b848b1c186d0d6672ffc20855c9ad855902004d8adb0460489bf8c959",
