      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛前让我演讲一小时，\n还有将我的等身大奖杯强制邮寄给赢家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b92a42679cb71565adfa3cde551b1177e41234efb55fd1649d1e4551aec779e1",
