      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "他们只愿意让步到这里。这种内容也能\n叫做纪念赛，不觉得滑稽可笑吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6a7e9ee8ec3937acf23e17c8d8b277b83f221ba2c237242a467c37f0b86e63d",
